    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/2eb1649e-7fcf-4e6a-ac4c-ef7e24e55535-01/AwardCriterion$_ContractNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_AwardingTerms1_AwardingCriterion1_SubordinateAwardingCriterion2>,
